# Convex
.convex/
# packages/convex/convex/_generated is committed (see api.d.ts header)

# OMO planning workspace (evidence artifacts only — plans and drafts are tracked)
# Must exclude the CONTENTS, not the directory: git does not descend into an
# excluded directory, so `.omo/evidence/` would make the negation below
# unreachable.
.omo/evidence/*
# Exception: the device notification baseline. Later work adds a second
# delivery Tier (ADR 0003) and must be diffed against a known-good starting
# point, so this artifact has to exist in a clean checkout rather than only on
# the machine that produced it. Everything else under evidence/ stays ignored.
!.omo/evidence/issue-5-baseline-all-cases.json
# Exception: the write-path cutover run diffed against that baseline. Tracked
# for the same reason and by the same rule — `docs/poc-results.md` cites it as
# the evidence closing issue #6, and a citation to a file that exists only on
# one machine is not evidence. The three per-pass reports it was merged from
# stay ignored: this one records which pass evaluated each case, so they add
# nothing a clean checkout needs.
!.omo/evidence/issue-6-cutover-verification.json

